## Demo secrets
secrets.json

## Demo: MCP server - include VS Code workspace files
## (settings.json is already un-ignored by the general .vscode/* rule above;
##  mcp.json is MCP-specific so it needs an explicit negation here)
!src/demos/McpServerDemo/open_in_vscode/.vscode/mcp.json

## Demo: Distributed services - exclude Mosquitto directory
src/demos/DistributedServicesDemo/mosquitto/
.env
__pycache__
